      "description": "Code intelligence with tree-sitter and LSP for semantic code analysis and navigation. Language auto-detected from file extension.\n\nSymbol: Any named element in code — function names, class names, variable names, constants, type names, interfaces, enums.\n\nTREE-SITTER OPERATIONS:\n• search_symbols — Find symbol definitions by name across workspace. Fuzzy by default.\n• lookup_symbols — Batch lookup specific symbols (max 10) with optional source code.\n• get_document_symbols — List all symbols in a file.\n• generate_codebase_overview — Directory tree with file counts, LOC, and symbol summary.\n• search_codebase_map — Focused directory exploration with symbol hints.\n• pattern_search — AST structural search using patterns with metavariables ($VAR, $$$).\n• pattern_rewrite — AST structural transformation. Dry run by default.\n\nLSP OPERATIONS (require file_path, row, column unless noted — row and column are 1-based):\n• goto_definition — Jump to symbol definition at position.\n• find_references — Find all references to symbol at position.\n• rename_symbol — Rename symbol at position (requires new_name).\n• format_code — Format a file (requires file_path only).\n• hover — Get type/documentation info at position.\n• completion — Get completion suggestions at position.\n• diagnostics — Get errors/warnings for a file (requires file_path only).\n\nWORKFLOWS:\n• \"Where is X defined?\" → search_symbols with symbol_name\n• \"What's in this file?\" → get_document_symbols with file_path\n• \"Show me these functions\" → lookup_symbols with symbols array and include_source=true\n• \"What does this project look like?\" → generate_codebase_overview\n• \"What's in the src/tools directory?\" → search_codebase_map with path\n• \"Find all console.log calls\" → pattern_search with pattern=\"console.log($ARG)\"\n• \"Replace var with const\" → pattern_rewrite with pattern=\"var $N = $V\", replacement=\"const $N = $V\"\n• \"Go to definition of foo\" → goto_definition with file_path, row, column\n• \"Find all usages of bar\" → find_references with file_path, row, column\n• \"Rename baz to qux\" → rename_symbol with file_path, row, column, new_name\n• \"Format this file\" → format_code with file_path\n• \"What type is this?\" → hover with file_path, row, column\n• \"What can I type here?\" → completion with file_path, row, column\n• \"Show errors\" → diagnostics with file_path",
